# Don't leak nested AI-assistant guidance brought in from upstream
# protocol clones (e.g. Sui ships its own CLAUDE.md and .claude/).
# The repo-root CLAUDE.md (project rules) stays trackable.
**/.claude/
**/CLAUDE.local.md
code/*/CLAUDE.md

